  "project_description": "Embed ArcGIS StoryMaps in Drupal sites using a configurable block and admin settings.\n\n Admin Configuration: \n \n Settings page at /admin/config/services/arcgis-storymaps \n Site administrators can set the Story ID and root node selector \n \n Custom Block: \n \n Outputs the ArcGIS StoryMaps embed script using configured values \n Can be placed via block layout or referenced in content types (e.g., with the Block Field module) \n \n How to Use: \n \n Enable the module \n Configure Story ID and root node in the admin settings \n Place the block or reference it in your content types \n Back to top",
